# HomeGuard AI — Full-Stack MVP Implementation Plan

**AI-powered preventive household intelligence platform**
*Predict problems. Prevent costs.*

## Overview

Build a complete full-stack MVP with:
- **Frontend**: Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui + Recharts
- **Backend**: FastAPI + Python + scikit-learn
- **Database**: Supabase PostgreSQL
- **ML**: Real trained models (Random Forest) for electricity forecasting & appliance health
- **OCR**: Gemini Vision API with manual-entry fallback

> [!NOTE]
> All electricity and appliance data is synthetic/demo data for hackathon demonstration purposes.

