### Phase 2: Database Schema (Supabase)

#### [NEW] `backend/app/database/schema.sql`

**Tables:**

1. **`users`** — Demo user record
2. **`electricity_readings`** — Monthly kWh + bill data (12 months)
3. **`electricity_predictions`** — Stored predictions
4. **`appliances`** — Appliance registry with metadata
5. **`appliance_readings`** — Monthly energy readings per appliance
6. **`maintenance_records`** — Maintenance history
7. **`insights`** — Generated AI insights
8. **`uploaded_bills`** — OCR upload records
9. **`recommendations`** — Action center items

**Key relationships:**
- `electricity_readings` → `users` (user_id FK)
- `appliances` → `users` (user_id FK)
- `appliance_readings` → `appliances` (appliance_id FK)
- `maintenance_records` → `appliances` (appliance_id FK)
- All other tables reference `users`

