**Electricity** (Sep 2025 → Aug 2026):
- Gradual increase from ~180 kWh to ~310 kWh
- Summer spike (May-Aug) due to AC usage
- Anomaly: September consumption 24% above rolling baseline

**Appliances:**

| Appliance | Age | Health | Risk | Story |
|-----------|-----|--------|------|-------|
| Refrigerator | 4yr | 64/100 | Moderate-High | Energy climbing +18%, no maintenance 10mo |
| Air Conditioner | 3yr | 72/100 | Moderate | High summer usage, filter needs cleaning |
| Washing Machine | 2yr | 91/100 | Healthy | Recent maintenance, stable energy |
| Geyser | 5yr | 85/100 | Healthy | Seasonal use, maintained |
| Microwave | 1yr | 95/100 | Healthy | New, normal usage |
| Television | 3yr | 88/100 | Healthy | Stable consumption |

**Connected Insight:** "Electricity up 24% → Refrigerator (+18% energy) is strongest contributor → Health: 64/100 → Schedule maintenance"

